  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Downward Accountability Capacity Building Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the roll-out of downward accountability in the CST office and with partners in Ethiopia. This has already been piloted through the Civil Society programme but this project will support its roll out among partners of all thematic programmes. The project will support at least 15 partners to fill the CAFOD downward accountability framework and develop a clear action plans. The project will provide training, accompaniment and relevant material to partners.</narrative>
  </description>
